You do know that NT 4.0/SP6 was the last version of NT for the ALPHA ?

There is a password option on the SRM console. It sounds like this
has been set.

The procedure for switching between the SRM and ARC consoles is
documented in the OpenVMS FAQ:

  http://www.openvms.compaq.com/wizard/openvms_faq.html

in the section titled:

  ALPHA21.  How do I switch between AlphaBIOS/ARC and SRM consoles? 


The section titled:

  MGMT5.  I've forgotten the SYSTEM password - what can I do?

mentions the console password and that resetting it may require
a hardware service call.

BTW, the two OSF newsgroups:

  o comp.unix.osf.misc 
  o comp.unix.osf.osf1 

are obsolete, having been replaced by the comp.unix.tru64 newsgroup.

